        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:ring#e-99b797e066a6b8fa",
          "text": "When the final bell rang in June, I walked away with a yearbook full of messages about writing’s most powerful significance – the ability to connect people, to put us in another’s skin, to teach us what it means to be human.",
